# Secure AWS Account Baseline

## What this is
A beginner-friendly setup showing least-privilege access in AWS IAM.

## What I built
- Root user secured with MFA
- Groups and users with scoped permissions
- Custom policy limited to one S3 bucket
- Role with trust policy

## What I learned
- Permissions are additive, and an explicit Deny always wins
- Roles give temporary credentials; users have long-term ones
- Why least privilege limits damage

